join Syn_Lucretia right
Syn_Lucretia: I’ve made it to the statue, but it’s guarded by even more monster-zombie-things. Convenient timing, looks like we’re both in for a fight. #id:6f
join Lucretia left
Lucretia: Yeah. Rohan is definitely here somewhere… #id:70
join Rohan_Moore center
Rohan_Moore: Talking to yourself, are you? I’m impressed you’ve managed to follow me this far… to where it all started. Tell me, what is your name? #id:71
Lucretia: Lucretia. I need to speak to Argus. The deals we’ve made – they’re not right. We’re destroying our world! #id:72
Rohan_Moore: It’s true. With each zombie mutated and demon brought to our realm, Argus’ power grows. A new empire is coming, one with him and I on top. Why else would I have released the virus? #id:73
Lucretia: You can’t trust him, Rohan! Together, we can still fix this. We can undo the deals we made. #id:74
Rohan_Moore: It’s too late. He’s here, and I will ascend to join him in ruling this new world, one without useless fighting and inefficiencies. Ultimate peace and order… #id:75
join Argus rightmost
Argus: Well done, Mr. Moore. You’ve accomplished your end of the bargain. And now it’s time for mine. Ascension… or, mutation. #id:76
Rohan_Moore: What? NOOOOOOO! #id:77
Lucretia: Argus!! #id:78